      "side": 1,
      "message": "May I know why do you pick these 3 tests in the packages?\n\nE.g. The connectivity module usually works very close with NetworkStack module.  Why do you not add NetworkStackTests as a part of automotive-tests?\n\nAlso, is there any bug that you\u0027re working on may be able to link with? I see your reply that you want to reduce the build time but I do not fully understand the intention here.\n\nSorry for clarifying more since I would like to ensure you will not lose the necessary test coverage.",
