      "writtenOn": "2022-06-17T03:42:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The NetworkStack tests are quite related to Connectivity module. I think we will expect the tests are also passed, even the breakage not because of your change. In most cases, we won\u0027t bypass the presubmit in case we miss some corner cases unless it\u0027s very urgent and we believe it\u0027s very safe.\n\nPlease ensure the TH is happy though I know it may be painful.\n\n@Remi,\ndo you want to take a look? Except the unclear intention and unknown test_suite definition. I do not see other concern here.",
      "revId": "4fe6b7455800ace8db90e025ca1995615f464011",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
